,"issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/106086","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106086","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106086.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106086.patch","merged_at":"2025-05-05T16:30:35Z"},"body":"Fixes: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/95561\r\n\r\nANGLE only reports support for `GL_EXT_texture_compression_bptc`, not `GL_ARB_texture_compression_bptc` or `EXT_texture_compression_bptc` (the WebGL version of the extension) therefore, we need to check all three so that ANGLE devices will properly use BPTC textures\r\n\r\n`GL_ARB_texture_compression_bptc `is the version for desktop devices while`GL_EXT_texture_compression_bptc` is for GL ES devices. However in practice, some desktop devices report support for`GL_EXT_texture_compression_bptc`. Ironically more desktop devices support `GL_EXT_texture_compression_bptc` than mobile devices.\r\n\r\n\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin"